# Local darklab_shell configuration overrides.
#
# The repository-free /config mount supports only this config.local.yaml file.
# Other local content overrides still use the source-mounted app/conf path.
#
# Add only the settings you want to override. The complete option reference is:
# https://gitlab.com/darklab.sh/darklab_shell/-/blob/v@RELEASE_VERSION@/CONFIGURATION.md
